Add a reminder from the rest of the line, or list reminders

Usage: nib t [OPTIONS] [TITLE]...

Arguments:
  [TITLE]...  Title of the new reminder; lists reminders when omitted

Options:
      --json                 Print JSON instead of text
  -l, --list <NAME>          Reminder list to add to
  -d, --due <DATE>           Due date: today, tomorrow, or YYYY-MM-DD
  -p, --priority <PRIORITY>  [possible values: low, medium, high]
  -h, --help                 Print help
